<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Welcome back | Northstar</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;700&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
</head>
<body class="min-h-screen bg-[#24352d] font-['DM_Sans'] text-[#18231f]">
    <main class="grid min-h-screen lg:grid-cols-[1.05fr_.95fr]">
        <section class="relative hidden overflow-hidden bg-[#24352d] p-12 text-[#f9f5ed] lg:flex lg:flex-col lg:justify-between">
            <div class="absolute -right-24 -top-24 h-72 w-72 rounded-full border-[36px] border-[#e36d45]/25"></div>
            <div class="relative flex items-center gap-2.5 font-['Space_Grotesk'] text-[1.05rem] font-bold tracking-wide">
                <span class="h-3 w-3 rotate-45 bg-[#e36d45]" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                Northstar
            </div>
            <div class="relative max-w-md">
                <p class="mb-5 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[.18em] text-[#e36d45]">Your place to focus</p>
                <h1 class="font-['Space_Grotesk'] text-6xl font-semibold leading-[.95]">Good to see you again.</h1>
                <p class="mt-6 max-w-sm leading-relaxed text-[#c3cec7]">Pick up where you left off and keep moving toward the work that matters.</p>
            </div>
            <p class="relative text-sm text-[#c3cec7]">A calmer way to come back to your work.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="flex min-h-screen items-center justify-center bg-[#fffdf8] px-6 py-12 sm:px-12">
            <div class="w-full max-w-md">
                <div class="mb-10 lg:hidden">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 font-['Space_Grotesk'] text-lg font-bold">
                        <span class="h-3 w-3 rotate-45 bg-[#e36d45]" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                        Northstar
                    </div>
                </div>

                <p class="mb-3 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[.16em] text-[#b94f2d]">Welcome back</p>
                <h2 class="font-['Space_Grotesk'] text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Sign in to continue</h2>
                <p class="mt-3 text-[#68756f]">Enter your details and get back into your account.</p>

                <form class="mt-9 grid gap-5" action="/login" method="POST">
                    <div class="grid gap-2">
                        <label class="text-sm font-bold" for="email">Email address</label>
                        <input class="w-full rounded-[3px] border border-[#dce2da] bg-[#fbfaf5] px-4 py-3.5 outline-none transition placeholder:text-[#9aa49e] focus:border-[#e36d45] focus:bg-white focus:ring-4 focus:ring-[#e36d45]/15" id="email" type="email" name="email" placeholder="you@example.com" autocomplete="email" required>
                    </div>
                    <div class="grid gap-2">
                        <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
                            <label class="text-sm font-bold" for="password">Password</label>
                            <a class="text-xs font-bold text-[#b94f2d] transition hover:text-[#e36d45]" href="#">Forgot password?</a>
                        </div>
                        <input class="w-full rounded-[3px] border border-[#dce2da] bg-[#fbfaf5] px-4 py-3.5 outline-none transition placeholder:text-[#9aa49e] focus:border-[#e36d45] focus:bg-white focus:ring-4 focus:ring-[#e36d45]/15" id="password" type="password" name="password" placeholder="Enter your password" autocomplete="current-password" required>
                    </div>
                    <label class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-[#68756f]">
                        <input class="h-4 w-4 accent-[#e36d45]" type="checkbox" name="remember">
                        Remember me on this device
                    </label>
                    <button class="mt-1 rounded-[3px] bg-[#e36d45] px-5 py-4 font-bold text-white transition hover:-translate-y-px hover:bg-[#b94f2d] focus:outline-none focus:ring-4 focus:ring-[#e36d45]/30" type="submit">Sign in <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></button>
                </form>

                <p class="mt-8 text-center text-sm text-[#68756f]">New to Northstar? <a class="font-bold text-[#b94f2d] hover:text-[#e36d45]" href="/">Create an account</a></p>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>
</body>
</html>